# Second tuned candidate for the Spring app: tuned-v1 with smaller limits.
# tuned-v1 peaks: live heap after GC 26 MiB, metaspace 43.6 MiB, code cache 8.9 MiB.
-XX:+UseSerialGC
-Xms16m
-Xmx48m
-XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=56m
-XX:CompressedClassSpaceSize=16m
-XX:TieredStopAtLevel=1
-XX:CICompilerCount=1
-XX:ReservedCodeCacheSize=16m
-Xss512k
-XX:MaxDirectMemorySize=16m
-XX:+UseCompactObjectHeaders
